% how to make a helix

% Rob Scharein, 15 May 2001


reset all 
cyl-rad=.3
draw spec

line dir 0 .1 0 % about to make a line in the y-direction
line num 160    % with 160 beads

line            % make the line
centre          % and centre it

translate 3 0 0 % translate it off to one side
swirl end 1800  % and give it a swirl
                % swirl amount is x full rotations











